OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FThe families of those killed in the
OL,7,FRAF Chinook crash have urged Prime
OL,8,FMinister Andy Burnham to meet them
OL,9,Fwithin his first 100 days in office
OL,10,Fand order a fresh, independent review
OL,11,Finto the 1994 tragedy.
OL,13,FA High Court judge ruled this month
OL,14,Fthat the families of several victims
OL,15,Fof the crash could not bring a legal
OL,16,Fclaim against the Ministry of Defence
OL,17,F(MoD) over the incident.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/11
