PN,41602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FTwenty-nine serving military personnel
OL,7,Fdied when the Chinook HC-2 helicopter
OL,8,Fcrashed into the Mull of Kintyre in
OL,9,Fsouth-west Scotland on June 2 1994
OL,10,Fduring a flight from RAF Aldergrove in
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,13,FWhile the 2011 Mull of Kintyre inquiry
OL,14,Foverturned an initial decision to
OL,15,Fblame the pilots, Richard Cook and
OL,16,FJonathan Tapper who were based at RAF
OL,17,FOdiham in Hampshire, it did not
OL,18,Fdetermine the cause of the crash.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FThe Chinook Justice Campaign (CJC),
OL,7,Fwhich is made up of more than 55
OL,8,Ffamily members of 25 of the victims,
OL,9,Fsought to challenge the MoD's "ongoing
OL,10,Ffailure" to set up an "independent and
OL,11,Feffective investigation" into the
OL,12,Fcrash.
OL,14,FHowever, a High Court judge's ruling
OL,15,Fthrew out the case as the claim had
OL,16,Fbeen brought too late.
OL,26,@qD@_OUrD@HO]rD@WOUsD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FThe CJC legal team has said it will
OL,7,Ftake the case to the European Court of
OL,8,FHuman Rights, but Matt Tobias, son of
OL,9,FLieutenant Colonel John Tobias who was
OL,10,Fkilled in the crash, said the families
OL,11,F"do not want years of further
OL,12,Flitigation".
OL,14,FMr Tobias said the Prime Minister "has
OL,15,Fthe power to prevent that" by ordering
OL,16,Fa fresh independent review.
OL,26,@sD@AOUtD@KO]vD@cOUwD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FHe said: "We would urge Mr Burnham to
OL,7,Fmeet us within his first 100 days in
OL,8,Foffice so we can present the evidence
OL,9,Fthat has emerged over recent years and
OL,10,Fexplain why we believe a fresh review,
OL,11,Findependent of the Ministry of
OL,12,FDefence, is now essential.
OL,14,F"Mr Burnham's speech in the House of
OL,15,FCommons, in which he spoke about
OL,16,Fending Britain's cover-up culture and
OL,17,Fstrengthening the duty of candour,
OL,18,Fgave our families real hope.
OL,26,@nD@JOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,F"We ask that he and his ministers give
OL,7,Fthe Chinook families more respect than
OL,8,Fwe received from his predecessor, who
OL,9,Fdenied us a meeting and an inquiry `
OL,10,Fbelieving MoD lies instead.
OL,12,F"After 32 years, we are not asking for
OL,13,Fspecial treatment. We are simply
OL,14,Fasking for the truth."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FThe CJC group has said it wants Mr
OL,7,FBurnham to establish a fresh review,
OL,8,Findependent of the Ministry of
OL,9,FDefence, with full access to all
OL,10,Frelevant documents relating to the
OL,11,Fairworthiness of the Chinook Mk2
OL,12,Fhelicopter and the circumstances
OL,13,Fleading up to the crash.
OL,15,FIn the letter delivered to Mr Burnham,
OL,16,Fthe Chinook families said: "Throughout
OL,17,Fyour career you have argued that the
OL,18,FState should never use its power to
OL,19,Ffrustrate families seeking the truth.
OL,26,@xD@\OU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,F"We respectfully suggest that the
OL,7,FChinook case now presents the first
OL,8,Fopportunity for your Government to
OL,9,Fdemonstrate those principles in
OL,10,Fpractice and should be the test case
OL,11,Ffor Hillsborough Law."
OL,13,FHillsborough Law was unanimously
OL,14,Fbacked by MPs in the House of Commons
OL,15,Fthis month.
OL,17,FIt would create a legally enforceable
OL,18,Fduty of candour which compels public
OL,19,Fofficials and authorities to act
OL,20,Ftransparently when investigations and
OL,21,Finquiries take place.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,417,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FThe families have requested that
OL,7,Fvictims minister Alex Davies-Jones, re-
OL,8,Fappointed last week, take up their
OL,9,Fcase as one of the test cases for
OL,10,FHillsborough Law.
OL,12,FTheir appeal is backed by former
OL,13,FConservative defence secretary, Sir
OL,14,FLiam Fox, who has also written
OL,15,Fpersonally to Mr Burnham urging him to
OL,16,Fresolve the case.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/11
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
