PN,41610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1785179922
OL,3,CChinook crash families urge new PM to
OL,4,Cback fresh review into 1994 tragedy
OL,6,FThe Chinook Justice Campaign has also
OL,7,Fwritten to new Defence Secretary Wes
OL,8,FStreeting urging him to "begin
OL,9,Fcorrecting the mistakes of your
OL,10,Fpredecessors".
OL,12,FAn MoD spokesperson said: "Our
OL,13,Fthoughts and sympathies remain with
OL,14,Fthe families, friends, and colleagues
OL,15,Fof all those who died in the Mull of
OL,16,FKintyre crash.
OL,18,F"We understand the recent court
OL,19,Fjudgment will be disappointing for
OL,20,Fthose involved.
OL,26,@pD@YOUrD@MO]tD@[OUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/11
